cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Configural Psychometrics: R and C++ engines for identifying minimally sufficient conditions"
abstract: >-
  Working R and C++ engines for the configural psychometrics framework:
  exhaustive (enumerate_msc) and constructive (pairmi) construction of the
  minimally sufficient sets for a target, with necessity, dispensability,
  and coverage diagnostics.
type: software
authors:
